<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 238 0 R
/E (In 2023, an estimated 97% of African smallholder farmers remained without agricultural insurance coverage5, despite 95% of Africa's arable land being rain-fed and heavily exposed to climate variability6. Insurance penetration across all segments in Africa remains below 3% of GDP7. Growing availability of satellite and weather data is enabling index-based products that were previously operationally impossible to deploy at smallholder scale.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [4 8 5 9 6 10 7]
>>
