854 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (Standalone market information services face a structural monetization challenge: farmers benefit from price information but are often not willing or able to pay directly. Value capture requires integration within transaction, logistics, or bundled service platforms. Information-only models are asset-light but struggle with revenue; transaction-enabled models can capture more value but require working capital, logistics coordination, and local operational presence.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
855 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 242 0 R
/E (A key behavioral constraint: access to information does not guarantee changed farmer behavior. Liquidity constraints, product perishability, and restricted buyer access can prevent farmers from acting on available information even when it is accurate and timely.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [13]
>>
endobj
