/S /P
/P 257 0 R
/E (A deeper structural tension: compliance requirements are defined by importing markets, and the systems used to demonstrate compliance often generate data flows toward buyers and international platforms rather than remaining under African producer control. This defines both a risk and an opportunity. )
/Pg 46 0 R
/K [11]
>>
