/Title (The nine use cases analyzed in this section were identified and refined through a structured co-design process conducted with more than sixty agritech startups across eight African markets. Each use case was selected on the basis of its relevance to real startup operations, its connection to concrete data and AI challenges, and its potential for operational impact beyond the proof-of-concept stage.  They span four thematic clusters:)
