/Title (AI4SU is a Digital Africa program implemented with Expertise France under the Data Governance in Africa Initiative. Through startup engagement, co-design workshops, and agritech-focused hackathons, the program tested how data sharing, open-source AI development, and applied governance frameworks can unlock value for African agritech startups. This report draws on the Briter Intelligence ecosystem mapping \(2026\), the Data Without Borders policy consultations \(Data 354 / Digital Africa, 2026\), and Digital Africa's operational program expertise.)
